{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Obtain Relic Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, you can visit a shop to purchase relic cards of your choice.<br>Relic cards enhance combos between your cards and provide various advantages during gameplay.<br>Choose relics that suit your strategy and prepare for the next challenge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592570?t=1745067325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592570?t=1745067325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592570/d51741b366907e329eead8c8d960d75003aae60e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745067325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592570/d51741b366907e329eead8c8d960d75003aae60e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745067325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Obtain Relic Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, you can visit a shop to purchase relic cards of your choice.<br>Relic cards enhance combos between your cards and provide various advantages during gameplay.<br>Choose relics that suit your strategy and prepare for the next challenge!</p>","developers":["TRI BIRD"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592570/c7091567c80a9d0e681a1abd6f8b83f22d9b8064/header.jpg?t=1745067325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125243,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125243/movie480.mp4?t=1744905490","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125243/movie_max.mp4?t=1744905490"},"name":"\u6771\u4eac\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30c0\u30f3\u30b8\u30e7\u30f38","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125243/bfd74bf030ff9828bdcc64ecf1c538f665ccdf66/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744905490","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125243/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744905490","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125243/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744905490"}}],"name":"Alchemy Duel","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br><